<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed narrowly mixed in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 579.99, off 0.11.</p>
<p>Gainers edged losers 248 to 244.</p>
<p>The average price per share was unchanged.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 18,233,980 compared with 18,951,405, on Wednesday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1645 EDT/2045 GMT)</p>
</text>
